@@ -25,6 +25,12 @@ The weights take 70.8 GiB of the GB10's memory (73.2 GiB with the image tower an
 16,384-token window the server admits 8 streams at 0.35 GiB each and keeps a prompt cache of about 8 to 10 GiB, and
 about 24 GB of the GB10's memory stays available. Leave the other ranks' variables below unset.
 
+The MTP draft head uses the embedded draft vocabulary's FP8 output rows rather than the full output head.
+The target still verifies proposals with its unchanged full-vocabulary head.
+For lone drafted streams, `--mtp-drafts` caps MTP depth and `--mtp-confidence` sets a cumulative-confidence
+threshold instead of the cost-based cutoff. A zero draft cap disables drafting. Copied continuations and
+concurrent streams retain their existing lane policies.
+
